{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":34,"alongside":39,"kin":48,"engines":73,"usedOn":74,"sites":75,"crewed":81,"museums":82,"hero":83},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/zhurong.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":30,"tagline":13,"description":33},"zhurong","Zhurong","rover","CNSA","China","CAST","2021-05-14","RETIRED","2011-now","commercial-era","中国初の火星ローバー；Tianwen-1","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Zhurong (rover) — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zhurong_(rover)","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"祝融号火星车 — CNSA","https://www.cnsa.gov.cn/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Tianwen-1 — NASA NSSDCA","https://nssdc.gsfc.nasa.gov/nmc/spacecraft/display.action?id=2020-049A","deep",[29],"tianwen1",[31],{"type":32,"site_id":3},"mars","Zhurongは中国のCASTが製造した惑星探査ローバーです。中国初の火星ローバーで、Tianwen-1に搭載されました。2022年以降は休眠状態です。",[35],{"id":29,"name":36,"first":37,"year":38},"Tianwen-1","1回の打ち上げで周回機・着陸機・ローバーを火星へ届けることに初めて成功したミッション",2020,[40,44],{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"long-march-5","Long March 5 / 5B","中国宇宙計画の大型ロケットの屋台骨",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"wenchang-lc-101","文昌 LC-101","中国の大型ロケット発射台 — Long March 5によるTianheの打ち上げ、Chang'e 5/6、Tianwen-1、および月面帰還計画",[49,53,57,61,65,69],{"id":50,"name":51,"tagline":52},"yutu-2","Yutu-2","月の裏側初のローバー；Chang'e-4",{"id":54,"name":55,"tagline":56},"yutu","Yutu","中国初の月面ローバー；Chang'e-3",{"id":58,"name":59,"tagline":60},"perseverance","Perseverance (Mars 2020)","Ingenuityを搭載；火星サンプル採集・保存",{"id":62,"name":63,"tagline":64},"pragyan","Pragyan","月の南極初のローバー；Chandrayaan-3",{"id":66,"name":67,"tagline":68},"exomars-rosalind-franklin","Rosalind Franklin (ExoMars rover)","ESA の 2028 年火星ローバー — オクシア平原で生命の痕跡を探る 2 m ドリル。2022 年 Roscosmos 撤退で延期、NASA 発射機に切り替え",{"id":70,"name":71,"tagline":72},"curiosity","Curiosity (MSL)","原子力駆動のMars Science Laboratoryローバー",[],[],[76],{"type":32,"href":77,"name":78,"place":79,"text":80},"/mars/zhurong","Zhurong（Tianwen-1ランダーを搭載）","ユートピア平原","中国初の火星ローバー。347ソル間稼働し、1.92 kmを走破した。古代の大規模洪水イベントと矛盾しない埋没した地下層の証拠を地中探査レーダーで取得した。2022年の火星冬期間に通信が途絶え、CNSAは以後の通信がないことを確認した。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/zhurong/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
